eously play 1-player games, 2-player games and multiplayer games on all available platforms, such as computers, phones, and tablets. Same browsers with different operating systems: iOS, Android, Windows. And players can play for free everywhere, from the United States and Canada to the UK, Germany, and Australia. Let's explore games on AntGames without downloading.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhat are the feature game categories on "])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"AntGames?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames has various game genres, such as action games, shooting games, skill games, driving games and arcade games. We have diverse game genres for adults and kids, all are free games with no restrictions or downloads required. Some of AntGames' most feature game genres:\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/c/action\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAction games\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e such as Stickman Dragon Fight, Stickman GTA City and Clash of Skulls\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/c/shooting\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShooting games\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e such as Gun Mayhem, Time Shooter 2 and Shell Shockers\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/c/driving\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriving games\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e like Escape Road, Moto X3M and Sling Drift\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/c/skill\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkill games\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e like Geometry Dash, Poor Bunny and Wheelie Bike\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/c/arcade\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eArcade games\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e like Slither.io, Smash Karts and Pac-Man\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eYou can choose other game genres on our homepage with logo images vividly depicting the genre.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhat are the best free online games that are most loved on AntGames?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eSome of the top free games available on AntGames include:\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cul\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/g/moto-x3m\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMoto X3M\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e series - Popular motorcycle racing games\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/g/sling-drift\"\u003eSling Drift\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e- An addictive racing game with unique controls\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/g/time-shooter-2\"\u003eTime Shooter 2\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/strong\u003e- A first-person shooter with time manipulation mechanics\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/g/wheelie-bike\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWheelie Bike\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e - A challenging balance-based biking game\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://ant.games/g/real-cars-in-city\"\u003eReal Cars in City\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e - A 3D car simulation game\u003c/li\u003e\r\n\u003c/ul\u003e\r\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhat exactly are free games online?\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eFree online games are video games that can be played directly in a web browser without any upfront cost to the player.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAre all games on AntGames completely free?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eYes, all games on AntGames are completely free to play. Players can access and enjoy the full gaming experience without any initial costs or subscriptions.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhy are games on AntGames free?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames offers free games to provide accessible entertainment to a wide audience. This model is supported through advertising and partnerships with game developers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eCan I make in-game purchases?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhile the games on AntGames are free to play, some may offer optional in-game purchases for additional features or content. However, these are not required to enjoy the core gameplay.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhat platforms is AntGames available on?\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames is designed to be accessible across multiple platforms for maximum convenience.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eIs it safe to play free online games?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames prioritizes user safety and security. The platform uses secure connections and does not require personal information to play games.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eHow about playing on computer?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames is fully compatible with desktop and laptop computers. Players can access the site through popular web browsers like Chrome, Firefox, and Safari.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eDo I have to download or install something to play?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eNo downloads or installations are required to play games on AntGames. All games can be played directly in your web browser, ensuring quick and easy access.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAre these games suitable for all ages?\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames offers a var"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"iety of games suitable for different age groups, from children to adults.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhat age is suitable to play games on AntGames?\u003c/h3\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhile many games on AntGames are family-friendly, some may be more appropriate for older players. Parents are encouraged to review game content and use parental controls when necessary to ensure age-appropriate gaming experiences for their children.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eIn which countries can I play AntGames?\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames is a global platform where users can play for free everywhere, from the United States and Canada to the UK, Germany, and Australia. All you need is a browser and an internet connection.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWhy should you choose AntGames to play free games?\u003c/h2\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAntGames has compiled thousands of interesting free online games worldwide, along with fun, dramatic, horror, and crazy game experiences. Makes everyone remember the Ant Games brand, a free entertainment platform.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAll games are free for all ages, with no need to install an app or wait to log in. However, by logging in, you can save progress and compete for the highest Daily Streak against other players on global leaderboards, making AntGames special. With just one click, you can start your free gaming experience anytime, anywhere.\u0026nbsp; With just 1 click, you can start your free gaming experience anytime, anywhere.\u003c/p\u003e21:{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"Arcade\",\"slug\":\"arcade\",\"image\":\"categories/1704428280-arcade.png\",\"is_tag\":0,\"has_parent\":0}\n22:{\"id\":90,\"name\":\"2 Players\",\"slug\":\"2-players\",\"image\":\"categories/1704444362-2-player-games.png\",\"is_tag\":1,\"has_parent\":1}\n23:{\"id\":126,\"name\":\"Multiplayer\",\"slug\":\"multiplayer\",\"image\":\"categories/1704444080-multiplayer.png\",\"is_tag\":1,\"has_parent\":0}\n24:{\"id\":166,\"name\":\".io Games\",\"slug\":\"io-games\",\"image\":\"categories/1704433083-io-games.png\",\"is_tag\":0,\"has_parent\":0}\n25:{\"id\":998,\"name\":\"For Girls\",\"slug\":\"for-girls\",\"image\":\"categories/1728381563-for-girls.webp\",\"is_tag\":0,\"has_parent\":0}\n26:{\"id\":999,\"name\":\"For Boys\",\"slug\":\"for-boys\",\"image\":\"categories/1728381582-for-boys.webp\",\"is_tag\":0,\"has_parent\":0}\n27:{\"id\":1000,\"name\":\"1 Player\",\"slug\":\"1-player\",\"image\":\"categories/1728382123-1-player.webp\",\"is_tag\":1,\"has_parent\":1}\n20:[\"$21\",\"$22\",\"$23\",\"$24\",\"$25\",\"$26\",\"$27\"]\n1f:{\"desc\":\"\u003ch2\u003ePlay free games on AntGames\u003c/h2\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAntGames\u003c/strong\u003e is a \u003cstrong\u003epremier online gaming platform\u003c/strong\u003e offering a diverse library of \u003cstrong\u003efree games\u003c/strong\u003e to suit every taste. From exhilarating action and intense shooting games to challenging skill-based and nostalgic arcade games, AntGames has something for everyone. The platform prides itself on delivering high-quality, engaging content catering to casual gamers and dedicated enthusiasts.\u003c/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eWith a user-friendly interface and a constantly updated selection, AntGames ensures that players always have access to the latest and most popular games. Discover endless entertainment and join a vibrant community of gamers at AntGames today.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"categories\":\"$20\"}\n28:T71c1,[{\"title\":\"Deadpool \u0026#038; Wolverine: Dafne Keen Reveals How Often Channing Tatum\u0026#8217;s Gambit Caused Bloopers\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003e\\u00e1dasdasd\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eafne Keen\u0026#8217;s having a good go at Hollywood, having appeared in\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eThe Acolyte\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003eand\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003eas back-to-back projects. The two projects were so close together, in fact, Keen was bombarded with\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool\u003c\\/em\u003e-related questions during the press tour of the Star Wars series, having to avoid spoiling her appearance in the Marvel Studios film. At one point, the actor tells us, she nearly took a page out of the\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/andrew-garfield\\/\\\"\u003eAndrew Garfield\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0playbook and joked she wasn\u0026#8217;t \u0026#8220;The Werewolf,\u0026#8221; as\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/spider-man-no-way-home-andrew-garfield-enjoyed-lying-about-his-return\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eGarfield did prior to the release of\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eSpider-M"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"an: No Way Home\u003c\\/em\u003e\u003c\\/a\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;Everyone was asking the question, to the point where the interviewers would leave the room, Manny [Jacinto] and Charlie [Barnett] would burst into laughter. What do I do? Everyone single interviewer that comes in goes, \u0026#8216;So, Deadpool and Wolverine?\u0026#8217; and I\u0026#8217;d have to go, \u0026#8216;No, but I\u0026#8217;d love to,'\u0026#8221; Keen says on a special episode of\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eComicBook\u0026#8217;s Phase Zero\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0podcast. \u0026#8220;Then at one point, if you look at the interviews, we were finding it increasingly harder to lie, so Charlie started to be like, \u0026#8216;No, I\u0026#8217;m in it!\u0026#8217; When you asked me that question, I was really close to being like, \u0026#8216;I\u0026#8217;m not the werewolf,\u0026#8217; but thought that was too on-the-nose and couldn\u0026#8217;t do it.\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eKeen appears in\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e, reprising her role as\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/x-23-marvel-characters\\/\\\"\u003eLaura Kinney\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0\\/ X-23. It\u0026#8217;s unclear if she\u0026#8217;ll be back in the Marvel Cinematic Universe once again in\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eAvengers: Doomsday\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003eor\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eAvengers: Secret Wars\u003c\\/em\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"related-stories\\\"\u003e\\n\u003cp class=\\\"related-stories-header\\\"\u003eRelated:\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-dafne-keen-channing-tatum-gambit-bloopers\\/\\\"\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine: Dafne Keen Reveals How Often Channing Tatum\u0026#8217;s Gambit Caused Bloopers\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/disney-global-box-office-2024-record-inside-out-2-deadpool-and-wolverine\\/\\\"\u003eDisney Leading 2024 Box Office With $3 Billion Worldwide\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-wesley-snipes-is-like-blade-real-life\\/\\\"\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine: Dafne Keen Says Wesley Snipes \u0026#8220;Is Blade Off Camera\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-back-to-the-future-easter-egg-spoilers-lone-pine-mall\\/\\\"\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine Has a Hilarious Back to the Future Easter Egg\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003c\\/ul\u003e\\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003ch2\u003eWho\u0026#8217;s all in\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e?\u003c\\/h2\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eIn Marvel Studios\u0026#8217;\\u00a0\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/deadpool-wolverine\\/articles\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/a\u003e,\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003eDeadpool (\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/ryan-reynolds\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eRyan Reynolds\u003c\\/a\u003e) change the history of the Marvel Cinematic Universe with Wolverine (\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/hugh-jackman\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eHugh Jackman\u003c\\/a\u003e). The film also stars\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/matthew-macfadyen\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eMatthew Macfadyen\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Paradox, and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/emma-corrin\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eEmma Corrin\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Cassandra Nova, with the return of\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Deadpool\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003ealums\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/morena-baccarin-actor\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eMorena Baccarin\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Vanessa Carlysle,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/leslie-uggams\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eLeslie Uggams\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Blind Al,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/karan-soni\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eKaran Soni\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Dopinder,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/stefan-kapicic\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eStefan Kapi\\u010di\\u0107\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Piotr Rasputin\\/Colossus,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/brianna-hildebrand-actor\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eBrianna Hildebrand\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Negasonic Teenage Warhead,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/rob-delaney\\/"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eRob Delaney\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Peter, and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/lewis-tan\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eLewis Tan\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as Shatterstar.\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/aaron-stanford\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eAaron Stanford\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0is returning as Pyro from the\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eX-Men\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003efilm series, with\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/jennifer-garner\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eJennifer Garner\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0rumored to return as Elektra Natchios.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/kevin-feige\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eKevin Feige\u003c\\/a\u003e, Ryan Reynolds,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/shawn-levy\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eShawn Levy\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0and Lauren Shuler Donner produce with\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/louis-desposito\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eLouis D\u0026#8217;Esposito\u003c\\/a\u003e, Wendy Jacobson, Mary McLaglen, Josh McLaglen,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/rhett-reese\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eRhett Reese\u003c\\/a\u003e,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/paul-wernick\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ePaul Wernick\u003c\\/a\u003e, George Dewey and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/simon-kinberg\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eSimon Kinberg\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0serving as executive producers.\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0is written by Ryan Reynolds \u0026amp; Rhett Reese \u0026amp; Paul Wernick \u0026amp;\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/zeb-wells\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eZeb Wells\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0\u0026amp; Shawn Levy.\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0is now exclusively in theaters.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cdiv id=\\\"bottom0\\\" class=\\\"visuallyhidden\\\" data-tags=\\\"Andrew Garfield+Dafne Keen+Laura Kinney+Deadpool  Wolverine\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\",\"excerpt\":\"\",\"img\":\"\\/assets\\/noimage.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/blog\\/world-records\\/adsad-fghf\\/\"},{\"title\":\"Marvel Studios has now crossed $30\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003eMarvel Studios has now crossed $30 billion at the box office and fans are stunned by that lofty number. Powered by the runaway success of Deadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine, the Marvel Cinematic Universe now sits at the top of the entertainment landscape when it comes to bringing home the bacon. Reports today indicate that Ryan Reynolds and Hugh Jackman\u0026#8217;s multiverse romp will pass over $500 million at the worldwide box office in less than a week. So, things continue to improve for the highest-grossing film franchise of all-time. You can expect that number to keep climbing for Deadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine as well. So, a good month ends on a high-note for Marvel Studios.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eAs fans continue to discuss all those reveals at San Diego Comic-Con, Marvel dropped some statistics about their latest milestone. Each one of the 34 MCU movies have opened at #1 at the box office. Of those releases, 11 of those movie have crossed over $1 billion globally. (Wildly enough, two of them have brought home $2 billion.) On the list of top-grossing films, Marvel is the owner of the numbers 2, 6, 7, and 10 spots in the rankings. Could Deadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine angle its way into that discussion, we\u0026#8217;ll all have to see in the coming weeks.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0is in the process of lighting the box office on fire. As the current number one movie in the world, Marvel Studios president\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/kevin-feige\\/\\\"\u003eKevin Feige\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0and director Shawn Levy have to feel great about the latest entry in the franchise. But, how good is\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e?\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-and-wolverine-review-marvel-mcu-spoilers\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eComicBook\u0026#8217;s critic, Jenna Anderson heralded the arrival\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0of Ryan Reynolds and Hugh Jackman into the lar"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"ger MCU. In her review,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-director-like-early-mcu-movie-character-stakes-important\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ethe heartfelt nature of the film drew some serious praise\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0along with some inventive action sequences. But, more than anything, the bond between\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0really shines through. Fox Universe fans have the perfect swan song for all those movies who have paved the way for the MCU in general.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;Instead,\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0keeps a thematic core t\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\",\"excerpt\":\"\",\"img\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/tai-xuong.jpeg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/blog\\/world-records\\/now-crossed-30\\/\"},{\"title\":\"Walt Disney Studios is\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003eWalt Disney Studios is back on top at the box office. Frank Pallotta, the company\u0026#8217;s Director of Enterprise Editorial Strategy, announced Monday that Disney is the first studio to cross $3 billion globally in 2024. That\u0026#8217;s from just\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/summer-movies-2024-releases-best-deadpool-planet-of-the-apes-streaming\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003efour wide releases\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0across three divisions so far: Pixar\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/inside-out-2\\/\\\"\u003eInside Out 2\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0($1.5 billion), Marvel Studios\u0026#8217;\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0(a still-growing $823 million), and 20th Century Studios\u0026#8217;\\u00a0\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/kingdom-of-the-planet-of-the-apes\\/\\\"\u003eKingdom of the Planet of the Apes\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0($396.3 million) and\\u00a0\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/the-first-omen\\/\\\"\u003eThe First Omen\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0($54 million).\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eInside Out 2\u003c\\/em\u003e, which launched over Father\u0026#8217;s Day weekend in June, was the first box office blockbuster of the year and stands as the highest-grossing movie of 2024 to date (though\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0is on track to become only the\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/rob-liefeld-says-hes-not-surprised-by-deadpool-wolverines-box-office-success\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003esecond billion-plus earner\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0this year). The Pixar sequel reached the milestone in 19 days of release \\u2014 the fastest for any animated movie \\u2014 and has since surpassed Disney\u0026#8217;s own\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eFrozen II\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0as the\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/inside-out-2-highest-grossing-animated-movie-ever-disney-pixar-box-office\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003etop animated movie globally\\u00a0\u003c\\/a\u003ebefore overtaking Marvel\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eThe Avengers\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0to enter the\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/inside-out-2-all-time-top-worldwide-10-after-passing-the-avengers-at-the-box-office\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003etop ten all-time highest-grossing movies\u003c\\/a\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"twitter-tweet twitter-tweet-rendered\\\"\u003e\u003ciframe id=\\\"twitter-widget-0\\\" class=\\\"\\\" title=\\\"X Post\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/platform.twitter.com\\/embed\\/Tweet.html?creatorScreenName=ComicBook\u0026amp;dnt=false\u0026amp;embedId=twitter-widget-0\u0026amp;"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"%3D%3D\u0026amp;frame=false\u0026amp;hideCard=false\u0026amp;hideThread=false\u0026amp;id=1820121365447622943\u0026amp;lang=en\u0026amp;origin=https%3A%2F%2Fcomicbook.com%2Fmovies%2Fnews%2Fdisney-global-box-office-2024-record-inside-out-2-deadpool-and-wolverine%2F\u0026amp;sessionId=b9f2a8f6db90dd3a6e67bfc3617bc4d59e6c1309\u0026amp;siteScreenName=ComicBook\u0026amp;theme=light\u0026amp;widgetsVersion=2615f7e52b7e0%3A1702314776716\u0026amp;width=550px\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" scrolling=\\\"no\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"allowfullscreen\\\" data-tweet-id=\\\"1820121365447622943\\\" data-mce-fragment=\\\"1\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/iframe\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ryan Reynolds and Hugh Jackman-fronted\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0threequel, after 10 days in theaters, is already the\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-passes-the-passion-of-the-christ-sets-domestic-box-office-record\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ehighest-grossing R-rated movie of all time domestically\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0and has propelled the Marvel Cinematic Universe franchise\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-marvel-studios-mcu-30-billion-first-franchise-milestone\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003epast $30 billion\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0at the global box office. Disney\u0026#8217;s theatrical slate for the remainder of the year includes 20th Century\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eAlien: Romulus\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0(out August 16th), Walt Disney Animation Studios\u0026#8217;\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eMoana 2\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0(November 27th), and Disney\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eMufasa: The Lion King\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0(December 20th).\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eDisney\u0026#8217;s box office performance marks a\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/disney-town-hall-bob-iger-town-hall-wish-box-office\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003erebound for the studio\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0after its 100th anniversary celebration in 2023 was marred by modest underperformers (\u003cem\u003eAnt-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0and the live-action\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eThe Little Mermaid\u003c\\/em\u003e), flops (\u003cem\u003eHaunted Mansion\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0and\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eThe Creator\u003c\\/em\u003e), and bombs (\u003cem\u003eIndiana Jones and the Dial of Destiny, The Marvels,\\u00a0\u003c\\/em\u003eand\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Wish\u003c\\/em\u003e). The only releases to be deemed a success: Marvel\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eGuardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0($845 million) and Pixar\u0026#8217;s leggy animated movie\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eElemental\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0($496 million).\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;We obviously want to build our studio back to making not only great films consistently, but [to] our preeminent status in the business,\u0026#8221; Bob Iger said during a\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/disney-town-hall-bob-iger-town-hall-wish-box-office\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ecompany-wide town hall\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0in November, where the Disney CEO addressed the company\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/disney-ceo-bob-iger-defend-studio-disappointing-box-office-performance\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003e\u0026#8220;disappointing\u0026#8221; box office\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0during its centennial.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eIger, who returned to lead the company with the exit of his successor Bob Chapek in 2022, had left Disney on a high note in 2019. That year, Disney set an industry record of $11 billion and released a record seven films that passed the billion mark individually: :\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eCaptain Marvel\u003c\\/em\u003e,\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eAvengers: Endgame\u003c\\/em\u003e,\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eAladdin,\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eToy Story 4\u003c\\/em\u003e,\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eThe Lion King\u003c\\/em\u003e,\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eFrozen 2\u003c\\/em\u003e, and\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eStar Wars: The Rise of Skywalker.\u003c\\/em\u003e\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\",\"excerpt\":\"\",\"img\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/EJDpCX3eduG6sc6kuZzBsm-1200-80.jpg.webp\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/blog\\/world-records\\/a-s-s-f\\/\"},"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"{\"title\":\"Deadpool \u0026#038; Wolverine Cameos Assemble in New Official Cast Photo\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003e[\u003cstrong\u003eWarning: This article contains\\u00a0\u003c\\/strong\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/strong\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\\u00a0spoilers\u003c\\/strong\u003e.] The mind behind the Merc with the Mouth\u0026#8217;s third installment can finally talk about those surprise\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eDeadpool \u0026amp; Wolverine\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0cameos. Director\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/shawn-levy\\/\\\"\u003eShawn Levy\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0had been teasing that the Marvel Studios movie \\u2014 which\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-and-wolverine-spoiler-warning-teaser-trailer-marvel-studios\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eofficially lifted\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0its spoiler embargo with footage\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-shares-official-footage-of-its-major-cameos\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eoffering a glimpse\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0at characters who were otherwise kept out of the marketing \\u2014 contains a \u0026#8220;multitude of character cameos.\u0026#8221; The most unexpected: former\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eSuperman\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0star Henry Cavill\u0026#8217;s\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-henry-cavill-breaks-silence-shocking-mcu-debut\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ecigar-chomping \u0026#8220;Cavillrine\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/chris-evans\\/\\\"\u003eChris Evans\u003c\\/a\u003e\u0026#8216;\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-chris-evans-human-torch-return-dream-come-true\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003eJohnny Storm\\/Human Torch\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0from the Fox-made\\u00a0\u003cem\u003eFantastic Four\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0movies.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eNow that the secret is out, Levy took to social media to share a behind-the-scenes cast photo. \u0026#8220;If there\u0026#8217;s a director Heaven, I think I found it,\u0026#8221; Levy captioned the image, which features the director posed with\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/ryan-reynolds\\/\\\"\u003eRyan Reynolds\u003c\\/a\u003e,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/hugh-jackman\\/\\\"\u003eHugh Jackman\u003c\\/a\u003e,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/channing-tatum-actor\\/\\\"\u003eChanning Tatum\u003c\\/a\u003e, Wesley Snipes,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/jennifer-garner\\/\\\"\u003eJennifer Garner\u003c\\/a\u003e, and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/dafne-keen\\/\\\"\u003eDafne Keen\u003c\\/a\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eWhen Wade Wilson (Reynolds) and a Logan\\/Wolverine variant (Jackman) find themselves trapped in the Void \\u2014 the \u0026#8220;metaphysical junkyard\u0026#8221; where the Time Variance Authority dumps multiverse castoffs, including Professor X\u0026#8217;s evil twin sister, Cassandra Nova (Emma Corrin) \\u2014 they join a resistance based in the borderlands. The team includes such heroes as Blade (Snipes), Elektra (Garner), X-23 (Keen), and Gambit (Tatum), the last-surviving members of a motley Resistance cobbled together from abandoned franchises. (Characters mentioned as having been\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/deadpool-wolverine-deaths-cassandra-nova-killed-punisher-daredevil-quicksilver\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ekilled off-screen\u003c\\/a\u003e: Daredevil, The Punisher, Quicksilver, and Magneto.)\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;Everybody we asked said yes and somehow made the time,\u0026#8221; Levy told\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/ew.com\\/deadpool-and-wolverine-spoilers-shawn-levy-superhero-fatigue-box-office-exclusive-8690035\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noopener\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eEW\u003c\\/em\u003e\u003c\\/a\u003e. \u0026#8220;Jen, Channing, Dafne, and Wesley, they flew to England a week before shooting on their own volition and desire because they wanted to learn and do the choreography of the action themselves. They came a week early right away showing a level of enthusiasm that is not at all the norm for someone who\u0026#8217;s just doing a so-called cameo.\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\",\"excerpt\":\"\",\"img\":\"\\/assets\\/noimage.jpg\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/blog\\/world-records\\/deadpool-olverine\\/\"},{\"title\":\"Shang-Chi 2: Awkwafina Shares Disappointing Update Following Marvel\u0026#8217;s "])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"Comic-Con Announcements\",\"content\":\"\u003cp\u003eWhere is the Master of Kung-Fu?\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/marvel-studios\\/\\\"\u003eMarvel Studios\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/sdcc-2024-marvel-studios-avengers-doomsday-title-treatment-avengers-secret-wars-logo\\/\\\"\u003eupdated its upcoming slate\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0last month at San Diego Comic-Con, rebranding\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers: The Kang Dynasty\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0to\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/avengers-doomsday\\/\\\"\u003eAvengers: Doomsday\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0and providing a clearer path to\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers: Secret Wars\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0in the process, but left a number of in-development projects without new details.\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/shang-chi-2-simu-liu-director-destin-daniel-cretton-returning-marvel-sequel\\/\\\"\u003eHigh on that pending list\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0is a sequel to 2021\u0026#8217;s\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/shang-chi-and-the-legend-of-the-ten-rings-comicmovie\\/\\\"\u003eShang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e. The\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/simu-liu\\/\\\"\u003eSimu Liu\u003c\\/a\u003e-led film overcame the obstacle of being Marvel Studios\u0026#8217; first post-pandemic release,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/marvel-shang-chi-box-office-numbers-week-2\\/\\\"\u003eboasting one of the most consistent box office runs\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0in the franchise\u0026#8217;s then-13-year history.\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0was\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/marvel-shang-chi-reviews-round-up-what-critics-saying-spoiler-free-reactions-legend-ten-rings\\/\\\"\u003ealso a hit with critics\u003c\\/a\u003e, maintaining a 91 percent certified fresh rating on Rotten Tomatoes.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003ch2\u003eAwkwafina Provides Latest Update on Shang-Chi 2\u003c\\/h2\u003e\\n\u003cfigure class=\\\"aligncenter\\\"\u003e\u003cimg loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"noscript\\\" title=\\\"AWKWAFINA-SHANG-CHI-2-UPDATE-MARVEL-STUDIOS\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/sportshub.cbsistatic.com\\/i\\/2024\\/08\\/05\\/63f7cfdd-4a8f-45ec-89c0-6e72a212e81f\\/080524-awkwafina.png?auto=webp\u0026amp;width=900\u0026amp;height=468\u0026amp;crop=1.923:1,smart\\\" alt=\\\"AWKWAFINA-SHANG-CHI-2-UPDATE-MARVEL-STUDIOS\\\" width=\\\"900\\\" height=\\\"468\\\" data-item=\\\"63f7cfdd-4a8f-45ec-89c0-6e72a212e81f\\\" \\/\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e(Photo: Dia Dipasupil \\/ Staff)\u003c\\/figcaption\u003e\u003c\\/figure\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eProgress on a\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0sequel remains stagnant.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eSpeaking to ComicBook at the\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/jackpot\\/\\\"\u003eJackpot\u003c\\/a\u003e!\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0junket,\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0star Awkwafina noted that she still does not have any details on plans for a\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi 2\u003c\\/em\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;I have not,\u0026#8221; Awkwafina said when asked if she\u0026#8217;s heard any update on a\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0sequel. \u0026#8220;I haven\u0026#8217;t, but [those were] exciting announcements at Comic-Con.\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/shang-chi-2\\/\\\"\u003eShang-Chi 2\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0has been\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/shang-chi-2-simu-liu-director-destin-daniel-cretton-returning-marvel-sequel\\/\\\"\u003ein the works since December 2021\u003c\\/a\u003e. Marvel Studios was all in on the martial arts property back then, giving the green light to develop a theatrical sequel as well as\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/shang-chi-origin-mcu-ten-rings\\/\\\"\u003ea Disney+ spin-off series focused on the Ten Rings organization\u003c\\/a\u003e. Marvel also\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/tv-shows\\/news\\/wonder-man-destin-daniel-cretton-directing-pilot-epsiode-marvel-disney-plus-series\\/\\\"\u003edoubled down on its investment\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0in\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0director\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/destin-daniel-cretton\\/\\\"\u003eDestin Daniel Cretton\u003c\\/a\u003e, tapping him to direct\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers: The Kang Dynasty\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0and executive produce Disney+\u0026#8217;s\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Wonder Man\u003c\\/em\u003e.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/di"])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"v\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eThings have changed significantly since then.\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/avengers-the-kang-dynasty-director-destin-daniel-cretton-exits-marvel-mcu-shang-chi-2\\/\\\"\u003eCretton stepped down\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0as director of\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers: The Kang Dynasty\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0last fall, roughly nine months before the fifth installment was rebranded to\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Doomsday\u003c\\/em\u003e. Simu Liu had previously told ComicBook that he would \u0026#8220;assume\u0026#8221; he\u0026#8217;d be in the\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers 5\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0ensemble because of Cretton helming it, but is now unsure.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;I don\u0026#8217;t know to be honest,\u0026#8221;\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/simu-liu-avengers-5-shang-chi-2-mcu-plans-interview-exclusive\\/\\\"\u003eLiu told ComicBook this past February\u003c\\/a\u003e. \u0026#8220;I mean,\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/marvel-studios-move-away-kang-jonathan-majors-drops-quantumania-writer-avengers-5-kang-dynasty\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ethose things are so above my pay grade\u003c\\/a\u003e. I just want to continue to be a fan of it. When I get a call of like, \u0026#8216;Hey, this is what your in and this is where you\u0026#8217;re going to show up. And, this is when you\u0026#8217;re going to be need to be blocked out for,\u0026#8217; that\u0026#8217;s kind of generally what tends to happen.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"modernInContent\\\"\u003e\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003eRegardless of those\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Avengers 5\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0shakeups, Liu maintained that\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Shang-Chi 2\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0is happening, and Cretton\u0026#8217;s directorial status there has not changed.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cdiv class=\\\"related-stories\\\"\u003e\\n\u003cp class=\\\"related-stories-header\\\"\u003eRelated:\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cul\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/marvel-studios-shang-chi-2-sequel-still-happening-simu-liu\\/\\\"\u003eMarvel\u0026#8217;s Simu Liu Promises Shang-Chi 2 Is Still On\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/simu-liu-avengers-5-shang-chi-2-mcu-plans-interview-exclusive\\/\\\"\u003eSimu Liu Speaks Out on Shang-Chi 2 and Avengers: The Kang Dynasty Plans (Exclusive)\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/marvels-simu-liu-teases-shang-chi-2-introducing-new-things-to-the-mcu\\/\\\"\u003eMarvel\u0026#8217;s Simu Liu Teases Shang-Chi 2 Introducing \u0026#8220;New Things\u0026#8221; to the MCU\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca class=\\\"related-stories-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/marvel\\/news\\/shang-chi-2-simu-liu-teases-avengers-crossovers\\/\\\"\u003eShang-Chi 2: Simu Liu Teases Newfound Power and Marvel Team-Ups in the Sequel\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/li\u003e\\n\u003c\\/ul\u003e\\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#8220;Destin is such a special filmmaker and\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/movies\\/news\\/marvel-shang-chi-sequel-destin-daniel-cretton-major-update-avengers-kang-dynasty-mcu\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"\u003ewe\u0026#8217;re very happy to have him on the sequel\u003c\\/a\u003e,\u0026#8221; Liu added. \u0026#8220;He\u0026#8217;ll be working on that and we\u0026#8217;re really excited to see what he comes up with. I think he\u0026#8217;s going to do a brilliant job.\u0026#8221;\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/awkwafina\\/\\\"\u003eAwkwafina\u003c\\/a\u003e\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0can next be seen in\u003cem\u003e\\u00a0Jackpot!\u003c\\/em\u003e\\u00a0when it premieres on\\u00a0\u003ca href=\\\"https:\\/\\/comicbook.com\\/category\\/prime-video\\/\\\"\u003ePrime Video\u003c\\/a\u003e\\u00a0on August 15th.\u003c\\/p\u003e\\n\",\"excerpt\":\"\",\"img\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/08\\/EJDpCX3eduG6sc6kuZzBsm-1200-80.jpg.webp\",\"link\":\"https:\\/\\/blog.ant.games\\/blog\\/wiki\\/shang-chi\\/\"}]29:T1593,[{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"kg:/g/11y6dpg5hz\",\"url\":\"https://ant.games/\",\"mainEntityofPage\":[{\"@type\":\"Webpage\",\"url\":\"https://about.ant.games/\",\"@id\":\"https://about.ant.games/#webpage\"},{\"@id\":\"https://ant.games/#webpage\"}],\"name\":\"AntGames\",\"alternateName\":[\"antgames\",\"ant.games\",\"ant games\",\"antgame\"],\"description\":\"AntGames offers a vast collection of thousands of interesting free online games from around the world. Whether you’re into fun, drama, horror, or crazy experiences, we’ve got "])</script><script type="903685bb1dbade251d94ad68-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"you covered with 30 game categories. We have diverse game genres for adults and kids, all are free games with no restrictions or downloads required\",\"disambiguatingDescription\":\"AntGames - Where the best free online games converge\",\"image\":\"https://ant.games/static/imgs/header/logo-v4.gif\",\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"url\":\"https://about.ant.games/\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.youtube.com/@antgames_itd\",\"https://www.facebook.com/antgames.itd/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/antgames/\",\"https://x.com/AntGamess\",\"https://medium.com/@Antgames\"],\"actionableFeedbackPolicy\":\"https://about.ant.games/\",\"award\":\"AntGames is the best free online games converge\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingCount\":\"5\",\"ratingValue\":\"4.6\"},\"founder\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Tung Thanh Dang\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/dttung.antgames/\",\"https://www.instagram.com/tungdtitd/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tung-dang-thanh-330412153/\",\"https://x.com/tungdtitd\"],\"url\":\"https://ant.games/dang-thanh-tung/\",\"@id\":\"https://ant.games/dang-thanh-tung/#person\",\"familyName\":\"Dang\",\"additionalName\":\"Thanh\",\"givenName\":\"Tung\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://ant.games/dang-thanh-tung/\",\"birthDate\":\"15-06-1991\",\"description\":\"I'm the Founder of ant.games, where I blend my experience as a PHP programmer and Golang with expertise in system development, UX/UI, project management, marketing, and team building. Over the years, I have expanded my skills to meet the increasingly complex demands in the tech and gaming industry.\",\"jobTitle\":[\"CEO\",\"Founder\"],\"gender\":\"https://schema.org/Male\",\"height\":\"1m75\",\"email\":\"admin@ant.games\",\"image\":\"https://ant.games/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/dang-thanh-tung.jpg\",\"nationality\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Singapore\",\"hasMap\":[\"https://www.google.com/maps?cid=9833726125529626052\"],\"logo\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Flag_of_Singapore.svg/188px-Fl